{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.20260506180000","title":"verify.sh is a verification entrypoint, not a sensor","desc":"Klaim bahwa verify.sh hanya menjalankan sensor yang ada, bukan mendeteksi masalah sendiri.","updated":1778003053789,"created":1778002979717,"tags":["zettel","agentic-engineering","verification","harness"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.20260506180000","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"8d1e20459e7dbaa592db8b0807d41ed2","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260506180000","id":"zettel.20260506180000","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260506180000","id":"zettel.20260506180000","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.agentic-engineering","alias":"agentic-engineering","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.agentic-engineering"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260506180000","id":"zettel.20260506180000","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.verification","alias":"verification","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.verification"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260506180000","id":"zettel.20260506180000","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.harness","alias":"harness","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.harness"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260506180000","id":"zettel.20260506180000","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.agentic-engineering.single-verification-entrypoint","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":10,"offset":535},"end":{"line":10,"column":70,"offset":595},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.agentic-engineering.single-verification-entrypoint"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.1778003596758","id":"zettel.1778003596758","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":3,"offset":948},"end":{"line":17,"column":28,"offset":973},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.20260506180000"}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"verifysh-is-a-verification-entrypoint-not-a-sensor\">verify.sh is a verification entrypoint, not a sensor<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#verifysh-is-a-verification-entrypoint-not-a-sensor\"></a></h1>\n<p><code>verify.sh</code> bukan sensor otomatis. Ia adalah single verification entrypoint: satu command stabil yang menjalankan check yang sudah disiapkan tim.</p>\n<p>Karena itu:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>kalau <code>verify.sh</code> hanya berisi <code>lint</code>, <code>typecheck</code>, dan <code>test</code>, ia tidak akan otomatis menemukan N+1.</li>\n<li>ia hanya akan mendeteksi N+1 jika sensor N+1 sudah ditambahkan ke dalamnya, seperti Semgrep rule, query-count regression test, atau runtime query profiler.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Intinya: <code>verify.sh</code> membuat definition of done executable, bukan membuat definition of done sendiri.</p>\n<p>Related: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.agentic-engineering.single-verification-entrypoint\">Single verification entrypoint</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">agentic-engineering (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">verification (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">harness (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1778003596758\">Review comments should be encoded as guardrails, not left in PR threads</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enable